<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- LYN59. USFM K.KACHINDA NT HEBREWS</book>
  <para style="h">Mahebelu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Elin̄olo lya Paulusi ku Mahebelu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mahebelu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Elin̄olo ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">HEBELU</para>
  <para style="imt">Okulimukisa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1"/>
  <para style="s">Amaywi a Nyambe Okubitela mwa Mwanaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1"/>Mu tinako ni mu mikwa no kupula Nyambe kame ana kwambanga na sitetu naku kale okubitela mwa anuhi aye, <verse eid="HEB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2"/>kono mu tinako tino no mamaneneno, kame aamba kwaaci mwa Mwanaye woyo abekile oku yola einu yonje, woyo kame mwa yonyene kame anatende elitunga. <verse eid="HEB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3"/>Yokame woyo omonisa ekanya ya Nyambe ni sifekiso esi ali mwa sonyene, kame a shimba einu yonje mu liywi no maata aye. Aba ana kumana okukenisa eibi, sebeli oikala ku lyooko no silyo lya Nyambe no maata onje naku wilu.<verse eid="HEB 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okuneneba kwa Mwana Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4"/>Kakuli yo bita amangeloi ku maata no kuneneba, simba elitina elyo ana biwi ni lya utokwa onene okubitelela oo. <verse eid="HEB 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5"/>Kakuli ku lingeloi li bine eli a naamba Nyambe nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Tiwe Mwanange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">balelo kame nina futuka Sitowe.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Simba kame libine elingeloi eli anambele Nyambe nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Kame sani tende Sitowe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">mi yonyene kame satende Mwanaye.”<verse eid="HEB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6"/>Mi kame aba sa lite mwanaye no mweli mu litunga, sebeli wamba nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">“Mulesele amangeloi onje a Nyambe amu lumbeke.” <verse eid="HEB 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7"/>Nyambe ku mangeloi onje kame ana kwamba nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">“Anyine otenda amangeloi aye emebo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">mi abika aye kame aatenda amalimi no mulilo.”<verse eid="HEB 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8"/>Kono kwa Mwanaye kame aamba nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">“Olubona lowe, wene Nyambe, ni lwakuta oku no kwaabwa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">Omulamu wowe Mbumu no kuluka omulamu no mubuso wowe no kuluka.<verse eid="HEB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9"/>Kame osinga esi no kuluka, mi kame otimbile eyi no kwaluka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">Abo cwale Nyambe, Nyambe wowe, kame ana waa wene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">ni maati no ku wabelelwa onene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">kame oli beulu no alikani.”<verse eid="HEB 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10"/>Kame sebeli wamba nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">“Weene, Mbumu, ku matatekelo kame ona kuumba elitunga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">mi amawilu kame atendile omusebezi no maoko owe.<verse eid="HEB 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11"/>Eyo yonje mba ibu, kono wene mbusiyala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">yonje mba ikulubala kanyi esikumango.<verse eid="HEB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12"/>Mbu ipungu kanyi mukanjo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">mi mbai futuka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Kono wene mbusiyala kanyi omo oikalele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">mi emyaka yowe ka itamba kubwa.”<verse eid="HEB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13"/>Kono ku mangeloi libine anambele nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">“Oikale ku lyoko lyange no silyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">oku twala abo sa ni tende eiila yowe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">esipula no malyatelo no makondo owe.”<verse eid="HEB 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14"/>Kasanji onje amangeloi kame atendile emebo eyi isebeleza Nyambe, eyi itumiwangwa oku sebeleza awo sawane okuyoyisiwa?<verse eid="HEB 1:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2"/>
  <para style="s">Okuyoyisiwa no Kuneneba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1"/>Mulibakaelyo, kame tu fanena oku tokomela onene eyi tu na yupu, nji cwale tulese okutundamo. <verse eid="HEB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2"/>Kakuli nji elin̄usa linambiwa ku mangeloi neli lya niti, mi onje awo ana kuulwa oku li kuteka ni ku likana nakuwana ekoto ina kwaafanena. <verse eid="HEB 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3"/>Ngasibine satu banduke nji tu keshebise okuyoyisiwa no kuneneba oko? Na likwambiwa oweli kwa Mbumu, mi na tuku lyambeliwa kwaawo ana kwiyupa kwa yonyene. <verse eid="HEB 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4"/>Nyambe niyonyene sebeli oongoteteta okuba oupaki woo mu isupo ni mu timakazo ni inu no kukomokisa mu timpo no Mebo No Kukena titabiwa okukumanena nomu asingela yonyene.<verse eid="HEB 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woyo Otu Twaletela ku Kuyoyisiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5"/>Kakuli kasa ku mangeloi oko Nyambe ana ku beeka elitunga elyo liiya, elyo twamba. <verse eid="HEB 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6"/>Nai kwambiwa kunjili nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">“Omunu anyine nji umu puluke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">Simba omwana munu anyine, nji umu babalele?<verse eid="HEB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7"/>Kame ona mubi okwikala kunji no mangeloi enako icana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">kame onamu fuku ekuwani no kanya neyi noku kutekiwa,<verse eid="HEB 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8"/>mi kame obeeka einu yonje kunji no makondo aye.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Cwalehe, aba abekile einu yonje munji yaye, ka si siya esinjii esi aulwile oku beeka mu maata aye. Nabakulingeso, katu simona kale nji einu yonje kame ili mu maata aye. <verse eid="HEB 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9"/>Kono kame tu mona Jesu, yonyene woyo ona ku bekiwa ba nako icana kunji no mangeloi, mulibaka no lifu ana yupu okukola kwalyo, kame afukilwe ekuwani no kanya ni likute mulibaka no ku yandela elifu, nji cwale mulibaka no sishemo sa Nyambe, na fele aanu onje. <verse eid="HEB 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10"/>Kakuli kame kuna kulukela nji Nyambe okubitela mwa yonyene ni kwa einu yonje iikaleko, mukulita aana no kupula mu kanya abo okubitela mu muyando aye, mbaa tweletele mukuyoyisiwa no niti.<verse eid="HEB 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11"/>Kakuli yonyene osi kukenisa nawo asiku kenisiwa, onje Sitoo ni mumweya. Mulibakelyo ka ene okwaa isana abaange. <verse eid="HEB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12"/>Cwale aba aamba nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">“Kame sa nambele abaange elitina lyowe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">Kame saniyeme wene mukaci no mukopano.”<verse eid="HEB 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13"/>Mi kame sebeli wamba nji, “Kame sa ni mu sepe.” Mi kame sebeli wamba nji, “Ya mene uno, naana ana nibi Nyambe.”<verse eid="HEB 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14"/>Cwalehe abo aana omu aku tabela mu lutu ni mu unyinga, mu mukwanongeso ni yonyene nashimbi kuunu ukufekile, nji cwale mu lifu lyaye asinye woyo oli ni maata no lifu, yonyene diyabulozi, <verse eid="HEB 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15"/>mi aliulule aanu onje awo ana ku yoya omoyo woo wonje mu ubika no kucila elifu. <verse eid="HEB 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16"/>Niti luli kasa mu ku tusa amangeloi, kono kame aneyi mu kutusa olusika lwa Abulahama. <verse eid="HEB 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17"/>Mulibakelyo neli nji afanene okutendiwa kanyi ainaye mu likute lyonje, nji cwale atende omupulisita munene no makeke ni kusepahala mu sebelezo ya Nyambe, oku tenda esitabelo no tifo no ibi no aanu. <verse eid="HEB 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18"/>Kakuli kanyi yonyene aba ana kuyanda ni kwetekiwa kame atwesa okutusa awo aetekiwa.<verse eid="HEB 2:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu Wa Kuneneba okubita Mushe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1"/>Cwalehe, anyi abaange no kukena, anyi mu tabelwe ku kwisanwa na ku wilu, mu lemuhe Jesu, omutumiwa ni mupulisita mukulu no tumelo yetu eyi twamba. <verse eid="HEB 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2"/>Na kusepahala kwa woyo ona kumu keta, kanyi ngeeso Mushe aba ana ku sepahala mu ndoo ya Nyambe. <verse eid="HEB 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3"/>Kakuli Jesu kame akutekiwa onene mu kanya eyi ibita Mushe kanyi omuyaki no ndoo aba akutekiwa onene okubita endoo. <verse eid="HEB 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4"/>Kakuli endoo einjili ni injili kame ili ni munu ona kwiyaka, kono omuyaki no inu yonje Nyambe. <verse eid="HEB 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5"/>Cwale Mushe kame ana ku sepahala mu ndoo ya Nyambe kanyi omubika, aba ana ku paka einu eyo ina ku fanena okwambiwa kulubala. <verse eid="HEB 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6"/>Kono Kilesite na kusepahala mu ndoo ya Nyambe kanyi Omwana. Cwale aci kame tuli asindoo yaye nji kame toongoteta mu tumelo yetu ni ukukumusa mu sepo yetu.<verse eid="HEB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Emamela Kwawo no kwa Pumena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7"/>Abakulingeso, kanyi Emebo No Kukena aba yamba nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">“Balelo aba mu yupa eliywi lyaye,<verse eid="HEB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8"/>mu lese oku tatafaza emicima mu ku futuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">kanyi ba liywaa liya mu na kwetekiwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">mu lihalaupa.<verse eid="HEB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9"/>Omo anjekulyenu aba ana ku neteka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">mi kame ana mono emisebezi yange ba myaka makumi anee (40).<verse eid="HEB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10"/>Mulibakaelyo kame nina kutinisiwa ku lusika olo ni kwamba nji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">‘Kame ayauluka enako yonje mu micima yoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">Mi kasi limuka etindila tange.’<verse eid="HEB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11"/>Kanyi aba ni kweta mu kutweba kwange nji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">‘Ka tamba okwingena mu pumulo yange!’ ”<verse eid="HEB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12"/>Abaange mu tokomele, omunjili kwaayi alese okulumelela okwiiba ni mucima no kwapumena okumi twaletela okutunda kwa Nyambe no ku yoya. <verse eid="HEB 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13"/>Kono mu kususuweze omunjili ku munjili mu liywaa ni liywaa, konji fela aba liisaniwa balelo, nji kuulwe kwaanyi woyo so tatafala omucima mu ku komiwa ku sibi. <verse eid="HEB 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14"/>Kakuli kame tuku tabela mwa Kilesite, konji aba satuleme etumelo yetu no weli mu koongola okutwala ku mamaneneno.<verse eid="HEB 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15"/>Eileminwe okwambiwa nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">“Balelo aba mu yupa eliywi lyaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">mu lese oku tatafaza emicima yenu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">kanyi mu kufutuka kwenu.”<verse eid="HEB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16"/>Anyine awo ana kuyupa mi sebeli amu shamaeta okumulwisa? Kasa nji neli onje awo ana ku tunda mu Egepita munji no ketelelo ya Mushe? <verse eid="HEB 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17"/>Mi anyine awo ana kutinisa Nyambe emyaka ina kukwana makumi anee? kasa nji neli awo ana kutenda esibi awo etinyutu too natikukwela ni kufa mu lihalaupa? <verse eid="HEB 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18"/>Mi kwa nyine awo ana kwetela nji katamba okwengena mu pumulo yaye, kono neli kwawo ana kuulwa oku mukuteka. <verse eid="HEB 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19"/>Cwale kame tumona nji kasi kutwesa okwingena kakuli kasi kupumena.<verse eid="HEB 3:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4"/>
  <para style="s">Epumulo no Anu a Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1"/>Cwalehe, abo esepiso no kwingena mu pumulo yaye aba isiliko, tu cile, mwendi anjili mwaanyi mba atuliwa ba ku kwangwa oku keela bo. <verse eid="HEB 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2"/>Kakuli eyambo no kuwaba eyo, nai kwiiya kwaaci, kanyi omo unakwiyela kwa onyene. Kono eliywi ana ku yupa kali sikwa tusa esinjili, kakuli kalisikuwana ni tumelo kwawo anakuliyupa. <verse eid="HEB 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3"/>Aci asi kupumena, kame tu ingena mu pumulo yaye, kanyi omo anambele nji, “Kame ni na ku nungu oluci mu kutweba kwange nji, ‘Katamba okwingena mu pumulo yange!’”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">simba nji emisebezi yaye naba ina kubwa oku tundelele ku matatekelo no elitunga. <verse eid="HEB 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4"/>Kakuli kame kuli abanjili aba ana talusa eliywaa no utanu ni twiili (7) nji, “Nyambe kame ana pumula ku misebezi yaye yonge mu liywaa no utanu ni twiili (7).” <verse eid="HEB 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5"/>Mi kame musibaka esi kame anamba nji, “Ka tamba okwikala mu pumulo yange.” <verse eid="HEB 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6"/>Cwale kakuli kusi siyalile esibaka no aanu anjili okwingenamo, mi awo ana kusepisiwa oweli kasi ingena, mulibaka no kwa pumena, <verse eid="HEB 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7"/>Nyambe na ku suma eliywaa linjili kame nji, “Balelo,” mi sebeli olyamba mwa Dabida, aba kuna kubita enako no kuleba, omo kuna kwambeliwa kale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">“Balelo, aba mu yupa eliywi lyaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:7">mulese okutatafaza emicima yenu.”<verse eid="HEB 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8"/>Kakuli nji Joshuwa, kambe kame ana kwaaba epumulo, kambe Nyambe kasi kwamba eliywaa lindina. <verse eid="HEB 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9"/>Abakulingeso, kame kusili ni pumulo no liywa no utanu ni twiili eyi isiyalele aanu a Nyambe. <verse eid="HEB 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10"/>Kakuli woyo oingena mu pumulo ya Nyambe, kame apumula ku misebezi yaye kanyi Nyambe omo apumulele ku yaye. <verse eid="HEB 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11"/>Cwalehe tulwele okwingena mu pumulo eyo, nji kuulwe omunjili okukwangwa mundila imweya no kwa pumena.<verse eid="HEB 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12"/>Kakuli eliywi lya Nyambe nilya kuyoya ni maata, lya kutweba okubita omukwale no kutweba ku maneku ayili mi kame li cuula oka keela ku matabelo no mebo ni mucima, ni ku mawaneno no ifuba ni ku mooko, mi kame lyatula mu wangu amaikuto ni minahano no mucima. <verse eid="HEB 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13"/>Mi balubala lwaye kakwisa esumbiwa eso siku shwekile, kono yonje kame ili aba nolikena ni kumonahala ku miyo aye woyo satuku tambwele twenyene kwa yonyene.<verse eid="HEB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Omupulisita Omukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14"/>Cwale aba tuli ni mupulisita omukulu, woyo ona ka kubita mu mawilu, yonyene Jesu Omwana Nyambe, tuongolele mu kwamba etumelo yetu. <verse eid="HEB 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15"/>Kakuli woyo tuli naye, kasa mupulisita mukulu woyo no kwatu yupela okukola mu mifokolo yetu, kono yonyene woyo mu ndila yonje na kwetekiwa kanyi aci, kono yo kakwite sibi. <verse eid="HEB 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16"/>Cwale tu shetete mu undume inene ku lubona lwa Nyambe no sishemo, nji tu tambule amakeke ni sishemo mi tu tusiwe mu nako eyi ifanena.<verse eid="HEB 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1"/>Kakuli omupulisita omukulu yonje ona ketiwa mukaci no aanu na bekiwa nji aimanene aanu kwa Nyambe, okulita etimpo ni itabelo mulibaka no ibi. <verse eid="HEB 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2"/>Kame atwesa okutenda osimacaba naa ayauluka ni kwayupisisa kakuli ni yonyene kame afokola. <verse eid="HEB 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3"/>Mulibakelyo kame anungilwe okulita esitabelo no ibi yaye kanyi eyo no aanu. <verse eid="HEB 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4"/>Mi kakwisa omunu otwesa okuketa nuukuba elikute yonyene, kono kame ana isaniwa kwa Nyambe kanyi Aluni omo ana kwisanenwa.<verse eid="HEB 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5"/>Cwale ni yonyene Kilesite ngeeso, kasi ku kununeka yonyene nji aku tende omupulisita mukulu. Kono kame ana beekiwa kwa yonyene woyo ona kwamba kwa yonyene nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">Tiwe mwanange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">kame nina tende sitowe balelo.<verse eid="HEB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6"/>Kanyi omo ana kwambela kame mu sibaka sinjili nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">“Tiwe omupulisita na mu tinako no kwabwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">kanyi omo ana kutendela Melekisendeki omupulisita.”<verse eid="HEB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7"/>Mu maywaa no unu waye Jesu sebeli olapela ni ku kumbela ni kukuwa onene ni myoti, kwa yonyene woyo otwesa okumu yoyisa okutunda mu lifu, mi nakuyupiwa kwa Nyambe mulibaka no ulapeli waye. <verse eid="HEB 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8"/>Simba nji neli Mwana, na ku kwiyeta elikute okubitela mu mayando ana ku yanda. <verse eid="HEB 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9"/>Mi cwale aba anaku tendiwa woyo no ku petahala, sebeli otenda amatatekelo no kuyoyisiwa no kwabwa kwawo onje amukuteka. <verse eid="HEB 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10"/>Nyambe na kumu beeka omupulisita mukulu kanyi omo ana kwikalela Melekizedeki omupulisita.<verse eid="HEB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etemuso mulibaka no kusiya Etumelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11"/>Mulibaka no eyi kame tukwite eino kupula no kwamba kono yaku bambaba okwitalusa, kakuli kame muna kesheba kukuyupa. <verse eid="HEB 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12"/>Kame munafanene okutenda aiyeti ba nako ino, mu si saela omunu oku miyeta kame amatatekelo no tituto ta maywi a Nyambe. Kame mu saela amawe, kasa eilya no kongola. <verse eid="HEB 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13"/>Kakuli omunu yonje woyo oyoya ba mawe osikwiyeta mu liywi no kuluka, kakuli osili mwanukana. <verse eid="HEB 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14"/>Kono eilya no kongola yaa kulu, awo akwiyetile oku keta eino kuwaba kweyi no kwiiba.<verse eid="HEB 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1"/>Cwalehe tute kuuso kututo no kukula mu tingana mi tusiye etituto no lin̄usa no ulapeli. Tulese okusuma kame omutomo no kufutuka okutunda ku misebezi na mbulwa tuso kono tupumene mwa Nyambe, <verse eid="HEB 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2"/>nou no tuto no tikolobezo ni kubeeka amaoko, okwinguka nwaafu ni katulo no kuta oku no kwaabwa. <verse eid="HEB 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3"/>Cwale esi mba tu sitende nji Nyambe mba sipumenene.<verse eid="HEB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4"/>Kakuli ka ku twesahala kame okuukela ku kubaka awo ana ku monyekelwa kamweya awo ana eteke empo na kuwilu mi kame ana tabelwa ku Mebo No Kukena, <verse eid="HEB 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5"/>mi kame ana eteke ouwa no liywi lya Nyambe ni maata no mamaneneno awo aiya. <verse eid="HEB 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6"/>Nji nakwi mutumelo yoo, kakutwesahala okwausa ku kubaka kame kakuli kame angongotela Omwana Nyambe kame ba mubonda woo ni ku mwenisa patalaza.<verse eid="HEB 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7"/>Kakuli omumbu ona lokiwa onene ku mbula eyo ina ku lokeliwabo ni ku lita eimena no kulya eyo itusa awo ana ilimi mba utambula embuyoti okutunda kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="HEB 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8"/>Kono nji kame ubeka emikona ni moopu, kaukwite tuso mi kame oli bebi ni kukutiwa amamaneneno kame so cin̄iwe ni mulilo.<verse eid="HEB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9"/>Asingiwa, ababo twamba ngeso mu taba yenu, kame tu kwela kweyi no kuwaba eyo iyoyisa. <verse eid="HEB 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10"/>Kakuli Nyambe kakwite saluluti, nji a pulame emisebezi yenu, ni lilato eli muna monisa kwa yonyene muku tusa aanu a Nyambe no kukena eyo mane mu sitenda. <verse eid="HEB 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11"/>Mi kame tulakaza nji omunu yonje mwaanyi amonise okutukufalelwa okulemuha esepo no kwiyala okutwala ba mamaneneno. <verse eid="HEB 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12"/>Nji cwale mulese okutenda ano kububa, kono mufanikete awo ana wana oku yola etisepiso, mu tumelo ni kutatelela.<verse eid="HEB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Esepiso ya Nyambe no Niti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13"/>Kakuli Nyambe aba ana kuba Abulahama esepiso, kakuli kakwisa omunjili no kuneneba woyo saetele sebeli okweeta yonyene. <verse eid="HEB 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14"/>Seli wamba nji, “Luli mba niku fuyola mane ni kupulisetwa.” <verse eid="HEB 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15"/>Mi cwale Abulahama sebeli otatelela mu kongola, mi sebeli obiwa esi ana ku sepisiwa. <verse eid="HEB 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16"/>Kakuli aanu kame aeta mwa woyo no kuneneba okwa bita, mi oku nunga oluci no ngeso ku mamaneneno kame lulita okumana etin̄ananyi. <verse eid="HEB 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17"/>Cwale Nyambe aba alakaza oku monisa omulelo waye onene kwawo sa yole esanda no sepiso nji kautamba oku futuka, kame aongoteteta ni luci, <verse eid="HEB 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18"/>nji cwale mu inu yiili eyi no kwafutuka mwa yonyene nji Nyambe ka twese okwamba amapwa aci tute kusicilelo ku ku yoyisiwa kame tu fanena okwikala ni susuwezo inene tuleme mu kongola esepo eyi ibekilwe balubala lwetu. <verse eid="HEB 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19"/>Kame tu kwite esi kanyi eniti ni kongola no linjanga no wato no moyo esepo eyo ingena mukaci no lwambi no sisilelezo konji ku linjaliya. <verse eid="HEB 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20"/>Omo Jesu ana ku tangetele kanyi omutwaleteli mu kutwimanena, ana beekiwa okutenda omupulisita mukulu okuta oku no kwaabwa kanyi omo ana kuikalela Melekizendeki omupulisita.<verse eid="HEB 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7"/>
  <para style="s">Melukizendeki Omupulisita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1"/>Kakuli uyu Melekizendeki ombumu wa salemu omupulisita wa Nyambe oli beulu, sebeli okuwaniketa ni Abulahama yo uka okutunda mu kwibaa aambumu mi sebeli omu fuyola, <verse eid="HEB 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2"/>mi kwa yonyene Abulahama sebeli omuba esi no likumi ku inu yonje. Yo no weli oku tolokiwa elitina lyaye nji, “Ombumu no kuluka” mi kame yo mbumu wa Salemu, okutalusa nji, “Ombumu no kozo.” <verse eid="HEB 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3"/>Melekizendeki kakwite sitaye simba inawaye, simba olusika mi kakwite amatatekelo no maywaa simba amamaneneno no moyo, kono kame afekile Mwanaye Nyambe sebeli otwalelela oupulisita okuta oku no kwaabwa.<verse eid="HEB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4"/>Ko mumone okuneneba kwaye, Abulahama onjekulyetu no kulimukiwa onene sebeli omuba esi no likumi ku inu ana kuhapa. <verse eid="HEB 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5"/>Mi awo aana a Lebi atambula oupulisita kame ana biwi etaelo mu mulawo okushimba eyi no likumi kwaanu eyo itunda kwa boo, simba nji nonyene aa kame atunda kwa Abulahama. <verse eid="HEB 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6"/>Kono uyu mulume no kwatunda ku lusika loo na ku tambula eyi no likumi okutunda kwa Abulahama ni ku mu fuyola, woyo yonyene ona kutambula etisepiso. <verse eid="HEB 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7"/>Abo kakwisa oku hakanyeha nji woyo oba embuyoti wa kuneneba kwa woyo otambula embuyoti. <verse eid="HEB 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8"/>Bano eyi no likumi kame itambuliwa kwaanu afa, mundila injili woyo ona itambula yonyene kame apakiwa nji kame ayoya. <verse eid="HEB 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9"/>Cwale omunjili mba fanene okwamba nji Lebi yonyene woyo otambula esi no likumi, na teneke esi no likumi okuta mwa Abulahama. <verse eid="HEB 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10"/>Kakuli abo Melekisendeki aba ana kukuwana ni Abulahama, Lebi yosili mu lipumo lya njekulyaye.<verse eid="HEB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11"/>Cwale nji okupetahala kame kuna sumiwa ba upulisita no lusika lwa Lebi kakuli munji no upulisita ou, aanu kame atambula omulawo, cwale kautokwa owo oli bo okubeeka omupulisita omunjili kanyi Melekizendeki mu upulisita, okubita omunjili ona isaniwa kanyi Aluni? <verse eid="HEB 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12"/>Kakuli aba kuna futuliwa mu situlo no upulisita, kame ku fanena oku futuliwa ngeso mu mulawo. <verse eid="HEB 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13"/>Kakuli omunu woyo twamba eyaye niwa mushobo mundina, mi kakwisa omunu no mushobo owo ona sebeze ba aletale. <verse eid="HEB 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14"/>Kakuli kame kulimukiwa nji Ombumu wetu kame atunda mu mushobo wa Juda, mi owo ouli omushobo ana ku ulwa okwambabo esinjili Mushe kweyi no upulisita.<verse eid="HEB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omupulisita Omunjili okufekile kanyi Melekizendeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15"/>Mi etaba eyi kame imonahala eniti luli ni ku bitelela, ababo ku neyi kame omupulisita omunjili woyo okufekile ni Melekizendeki. <verse eid="HEB 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16"/>Woyo ona beekiwa oupulisita, kasa okukumanena mulibaka lya njekulyaye, kono mulibaka no maata no moyo no kwaabwa. <verse eid="HEB 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17"/>Kakuli na ku pakiwa eyaye nji, “Tiwe omupulisita okuta oko no kwaabwa, kanyi omo anakutendela Melekizedeki.” <verse eid="HEB 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18"/>Cwale ku lineku linjili, na ku beekiwa kunyonga omulawo no weli, mulibaka no kufokola mane ni kuulwa etuso kwawo. <verse eid="HEB 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19"/>Kakuli omulawo kausitenda esinu no kupetahala, kono mu sibaka sawo kame ku neyi esepiso no kuwaba luli, eyi itu sheteta abeebi kwa Nyambe.<verse eid="HEB 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20"/>Mi eyo ka isi tendiwa oku nambulwa okweeta. <verse eid="HEB 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21"/>Kandi a pulisita nakunyima kame ana bekiwa oku ulwile okweeta, Kono Jesu kame ana bekiwa mu kweeta nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">“Ombumu na ete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">mi ka tamba kufutuka mu minahano yaye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">Tiwe omupulisita no tinako no kwa abwa.’”<verse eid="HEB 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22"/>Esi kame simonisa nji, Jesu kame atendile opaki no oulikani ou ubita ou no weli.<verse eid="HEB 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23"/>Aapulisita nakunyima neli ano kupula, kakuli elifu na li kwa kwangwisa okwikala enako ba musebezi no upulisita. <verse eid="HEB 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24"/>Kono yonyene kame aikala mu tinako no kwaabwa mi cwale mbatende omupulisita okuta oku no kwaabwa. <verse eid="HEB 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25"/>Mulibakelyo, kame a twesa oku yoyisa munako yonje ao aiya beebi kwa Nyambe mwa yonyene, yo yoya enako yonje okwa lapelela.<verse eid="HEB 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26"/>Mi kame kutu lukela nji twikale ni mupulisita no ngeso, no ku kena, woyo no kwanyazahala, woyo oku tabile naa sikutenda eibi, woyo otulekilwe beulu no mawilu. <verse eid="HEB 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27"/>Katende kanyi omu ana ku tendela apulisita anjili no akulu, mu liywaa ni liywaa oku lita amatabelo, oweli saye mulibaka no ibi yaye, bokame kame alita eino sicaba. Esi, kame ana si tende ka mweya mi na kubu, enako ana kutende esitabelo yonyene. <verse eid="HEB 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28"/>Niti luli omulawo kame u beeka ba upulisita no ku neneba aanu no ku fokola, kono eliywi nokweeta elyo lineyi oweli okubita omulawo, kame libeeka Omwana woyo onatendiwa no kupetahala okuta oku no kwaabwa.<verse eid="HEB 7:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8"/>
  <para style="s">Jesu Omupulisita Omukulu no Ulikani no Ubya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1"/>Cwale etaba no mu yambo twamba ninji kame tuli ni mupulisita omukulu, woyo oli ku Lyoko no silyo no lubona no maata onje ombumu mu liwilu. <verse eid="HEB 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2"/>Omubeleki mu sibaka no kukena ni tende no niti eyo kaisisumiwa mu maata no munu kono a Mbumu.<verse eid="HEB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3"/>Kakuli omupulisita omukulu naketiwa nji abe etimpo ni itabelo mulibakaelyo kame ku fanena nji uyu omupulisista mukulu ni yonyene ngeso alite esinjili no nubu. <verse eid="HEB 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4"/>Cwale nji osili bano ba litunga, kambe katendile omupulisita kame kakuli kwaali apulisita awo atundisa etimpo okukumanena ni mulawo. <verse eid="HEB 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5"/>Alemine okutenda emisebezi eyi ili esifekiso ni mwiinda naku liwilu, kakuli abo Mushe yo saela okuyaka etende, kame ana ku laelelwa kwa Nyambe aba ana kwamba nji, “Omone nji kame otenda einu yonje okukumanena ku inu eyi ona kumonisiwa ba lilundu.” <verse eid="HEB 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6"/>Kono kanyi omo kwikalele, Jesu na biwi esitulo eso no utokwa onene okubitelela eyi no kale kanyi oulikani aimanena ni wakuwaba, kakuli kame ina beekiwa ba tisepiso no kuwaba.<verse eid="HEB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7"/>Kakuli nji oulikani no weli kambe kawa si nyaziwa, kambe kakwisa esibaka no ulikani no wiili. <verse eid="HEB 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8"/>Kakuli Nyambe na wana oufosi kwa onyene aba amba nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">“Amaywaa kame aiya, kame kwamba Ombumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">Aba sani kuleme oulikani no ubya na sindoo ya Isilaele na sindoo ya Juda.<verse eid="HEB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9"/>Kasa kanyi oulikani ni na ku kulema na njeku lyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">ba liywaa aba nina kwalema ni Lyoko okwa twaletela okwatundisa mu naha no Engepita.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">kakuli kasi ku twalelela mu ulikani wange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">mi cwale kanisi kwaateteta, kame kwamba Mbumu.<verse eid="HEB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10"/>Cwale, ou wo kame oulikani sani kuleme na sindoo ya Isilaele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">munyima no maywaa awo, Kame kwamba Ombumu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Kame sani ingenyeke emilawo yange mu tingana too,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">ni kwin̄ola ba micima yoo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">mi kame sa ni tende Nyambe woo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">mi onyene atende aanu ange.<verse eid="HEB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11"/>Mi katamba okwiyeta omunu yonje ni mwabaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">simba omunu ni minaye okwamba nji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">‘Olimuke Ombumu.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">kakuli onje mbani limuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">okutangisa ku mwanukana okutwala ku mukulu.<verse eid="HEB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12"/>Kakuli kame sani ikale ni makeke ku uyi woo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">mi kani tamba oku puluka eibi yoo kame.<verse eid="HEB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13"/>Mu kwamba oulikani no ubya, kame aamba owu no weli nji kaukwite tuso, mi esi sihonehile niku kuulwa etuso kame sili bebi ni kubwa.<verse eid="HEB 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9"/>
  <para style="s">Elitunga ni Liwilu kame Ilumbeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1"/>Cwale oulikani no weli ni wonyene kame una kwikala ni milawo no sebelezo no kulumbeka ni sibaka no kukena namu litunga. <verse eid="HEB 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2"/>Kakuli kame ku naku yakiwa etende, eyi no kuleba, omo kuna kwikala olutala no lambi ni tafule ni sinkwa no aana a Mbumu kame sina kwiisaniwa nji Esibaka no Kukena. <verse eid="HEB 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3"/>Mi ku linjaliya no lwambi no wiili kame kwimanine etende isaniwa nji Esibaka no Kukena Onene. <verse eid="HEB 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4"/>Omo kame kuna kwikala ni aletale no gauda eyi icin̄elwa ensense, ni aleka no ulikani eyi ifukilwe egauda ku maneku onje eyo ikwite aleka no gauda kame ku na ku bekiwa akacoo no gauda aka kali ni maana, mi omulamu wa Aluni ona kushoshela amamuna ni matapa no mawee no kupatama ban̄olilwe oulikani. <verse eid="HEB 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5"/>Beulu kame kuna kwikala celabimu no kanya eyi iukumele esitulo no makeke, eyi no inu eyo katutwese okwamba mu utungi.<verse eid="HEB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6"/>Einu eyo aba ina lukisiwa ngeso, apulisita sebeli atwalelela okwingena mu tende no weli alemine okutenda eyi no misebezi yoo. <verse eid="HEB 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7"/>Kono mu tende no wiili, konji omupulisita mukulu yo ingenamo kono kamweya mu mwaka mi okuulwile okwashimba ounyinga owo atenda esitabelo sa yonyene ni sa ufosi no aanu. <verse eid="HEB 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8"/>Mweyi, Emebo No Kukena kame ina monahalisa nji endila no ka ingene mu Sibaka no Kukena onene kaisi yatuluka kale kakwisa taba okumona nji etende no weli isi imanine. <verse eid="HEB 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9"/>Eyi itendile esisupo no nako no bano. Okukumanena ni tukiso eyi, etimpo ni itabelo eyo ibiwa kaitwese okupetahalisa elizwalo no asikulumbeka, <verse eid="HEB 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10"/>kono kame itendiwa feela ni ilya ni kunwa ni inu no kupula eyi ifanena olutu no unu okutwala ba nako no kufutuka no ubya.<verse eid="HEB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11"/>Kono Kilesite aba ana ku monahala yooli omupulisita mukulu no inu no kuwaba eyo ineeyi, cwale mu kuneneba ni tende no kupetahala onene eyo nokwayakiwa ni maoko eyi itendile nji kasa no litunga lino. <verse eid="HEB 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12"/>Cwale Jesu kame ana kwingenangamo kamweya feela mu Sibaka no Kukena yo kashimbile ounyinga no tupuli ni tunamani kono ni unyinga waye owo ulita etiululo no kwaabwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13"/>Kakuli nji okukwawiwa no aanu no kwakena ni unyinga no tupuli ni tin̄undi ni mute no kanamani no sitole no ngombe esitabelo no kukenisa olutu, <verse eid="HEB 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14"/>ngasibine sakwikale ku unyinga wa Kilesite! yonyene mu Mebo no kwaabwa, naku kutenda esitabelo no kwa nyazahala kwa Nyambe, nakenisa elizwalo lyenu okutunda ku misebezi no kufa nji tu sebeleze Nyambe no kuyoya.<verse eid="HEB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15"/>Cwalehe Kilesite yo mwimaneni no ulikani no ubya, nji cwale awo ana isaniwa atambule okuyoola esanda ana ku sepisiwa kakuli elifu lina kutendahala na likwaa liulula okutunda kwiinu no kwiiba ina kutendiwa mu ulikani no weli.<verse eid="HEB 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16"/>Kakuli abo aba kuli oupaki no kun̄oliwa, elifu lya woyo ona in̄olo kame lifanena oku pakiwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17"/>Kakuli oupaki kame osebeza ba nako no lifu, kakuli kakukwite amaata abo woyo ona tende ngeso yosiyoya. <verse eid="HEB 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18"/>Mulibakelyo oulikani no weli ni wonyene kausi kutendiwa no kwa ulwa ounyinga. <verse eid="HEB 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19"/>Kakuli Mushe aba ana ku mana okuba etitaelo tonje no mulawo kwaanu onje, sebeli oshimba ounyinga no tunamani nou no tupuli okuwaneka ni meyi, ni wanda ona basiwa omucaa, ni haisopu sebeli okwaa ebuka no mulawo bamweya ni aanu onje. <verse eid="HEB 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20"/>Cwale sebeli wamba nji, “Ou ounyinga no ulikani ana ku laela Nyambe kwaanyi.” <verse eid="HEB 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21"/>Cwale ni mundila imweya sebeli okwaa etende ounyinga bamweya ni inu yonje ana kukutusisanga mu kulumbeka. <verse eid="HEB 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22"/>Niti luli, munji no mulawo kainu yonje ina kukenisiwa ni unyinga, mi aba kuulwile okwiita ounyinga kakwisa okulemenwa no ibi.<verse eid="HEB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Esitabelo sa Kilesite kame situndisa Eibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23"/>Abakulingeso, na ku kufanena okufaniketa eyi na ku liwilu aba ina ku fanena oku kenisiwa mu mukwa owo, kono eyi na ku liwilu ikenisiwe ni matabelo abita ano. <verse eid="HEB 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24"/>Kakuli Kilesite kasi ingena mu Sibaka No Kukena esi sitendilwe ni maoko, so nyene esifekiso sa woyo fela no niti, kono na ingene mu liwilu lyonyene, nji cwale akamonahale balubala lwa Nyambe mu kutwimanena. <verse eid="HEB 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25"/>Simba kasa nji aku tende esitabelo mu kuukela, kanyi omupulisita omukulu aba aingena mu Sibaka No Kukena mu mwaka ni mwaka, yo lemine ounyinga ou utendile nji kasa waye, <verse eid="HEB 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26"/>kakuli cwale kame ana yanda aka no kupula okutunda ku matatekelo no litunga. Kono kanyi aba kulingeso, na kumonahalanga kamweya nakubu ku mamneneno no nako okutundisa esibi mu ukutenda esitabelo yonyene. <verse eid="HEB 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27"/>Cwale kanyi aba kuna laelwe nji aanu onje kame safe kamweya, munyima okubinda sa kwiiye ekatulo. <verse eid="HEB 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28"/>Cwale Kilesite ona kutendiwa esitabelo kamweya okutundisa eibi no aanu no kupula kame sa monahale aka no wiili, mi kasa mu kutundisa eibi kono mu kuyoyisa awo amutatelela onene.<verse eid="HEB 9:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1"/>Kakuli omulawo wa Mushe kame uli ni mwinda fela no inu no kuwaba eyi iiya, kasa lutu luli no inu. Ka sitwese oku tenda, mu sitabelo sikufekile eso atwalelela okuba mu mwaka ni mwaka okupetahalisa awo asheteta beebi. <verse eid="HEB 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2"/>Kambesi ngeso, amatabelo kambe naku lezeliwa oku litiwa? Kakuli abo aa asikulumbeka Nyambe aba ku na mana okwa kenisa, kakwite amaikuto no sibi. <verse eid="HEB 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3"/>Kono mu itabelo eyi kame kuli esi pulukiso no sibi mu mwaka ni mwaka. <verse eid="HEB 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4"/>Kakuli kaku twesahala nji ounyinga no tin̄undi ni tupuli otwese okutundise eibi.<verse eid="HEB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5"/>Mulibakelyo Kilesite enako ana kwiya mu litunga, kame ana kwamba nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">“Ka usi singa esitabelo simba enubu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">kono kame onani lukisete olutu.<verse eid="HEB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6"/>Ka uwabelelwe esitabelo no kucinyin̄iwa ni mulilo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">simba esitabelo no sibi.<verse eid="HEB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7"/>Cwale kame naamba nji, ‘Kame ni neeyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">mu ku tenda eso si singwa kwa wene, Nyambe wange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">kanyi omo in̄olelwe eyange mu buka no muputo.’ ” <verse eid="HEB 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8"/>Aba ana kwamba yonyene nji, “Simba osinga simba okutenda eyi no mwelembo mu itabelo ni tinubu, etinubu no kucinga ni tinubu no sibi.” eyi kame ibiwa okukumanena ni mulawo wa Mushe. <verse eid="HEB 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9"/>Cwale sebeli wekeza nji, “Nyambe, kame ineeyi mu kutenda esi si singwa kwa wene.” Kame ana ku tundisa eitabelo no weli nji kubekiwe esi no wiili. <verse eid="HEB 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10"/>Mi mu libakaelyo ana kusinga Nyambe, na tukenisiwa mu sitabelo no lutu lwa Jesu Kilesite esi sina tendiwa kamweya mi nakubu.<verse eid="HEB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11"/>Mi omupulisita yonje kame aimana okutenda omusebezi waye mu liywaa ni liywaa okutundisa esitabelo no kukufeka, eso suulwa okutundisa eibi. <verse eid="HEB 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12"/>Kono Jesu Kilesite aba ana oukutenda esitabelo ba nako imweya mulibaka no ibi, sebeli oka ikala ku lyoko no silyo lya Nyambe, <verse eid="HEB 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13"/>oku tatelela konji abo eila yaye aba saikatendelwe esipula no malyatelo no makondo aye. <verse eid="HEB 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14"/>Kakuli mu sitabelo saye simweya, kame ana tende aanu okupetahala enako yonje awo ana kenisiwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15"/>Mi Emebo No Kukena ni yonyene kame itu pakela mu taba eyo. Kakuli munyima no kwamba nji,<verse eid="HEB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16"/>“Ou oulikani sani kuleme noo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">munyima no maywaa awo, kame kwamba Ombumu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Kame sani beeke emilawo yange mu micima yoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">ni kwin̄ola mu tingana too.”<verse eid="HEB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17"/>Cwale sebeli weekeza okwamba nji, “Ka ni tamba oku puluka eibi yoo ni uyi woo.” <verse eid="HEB 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18"/>Cwale aba kuli ouku lemena, ka kutendiwa kame esitabelo sinjili mulibaka no sibi.<verse eid="HEB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okuisana no ku Kongota mu Tumelo Mwa Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19"/>Cwalehe, abaange, aba tuli ni undume no kwingena mu Sibaka no Kukena Onene mulibaka no unyinga wa Jesu, <verse eid="HEB 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20"/>mu ndila no ubya ni kuyoya, eyo ana tu yatulwele mulibaka no lwaambi okutalusa nji, mu lutu lwaye. <verse eid="HEB 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21"/>Mi simba nji kame tuli ni mupulisita munene woyo obeekelwe oku busa endoo ya Nyambe, <verse eid="HEB 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22"/>tu shetete ni micima no niti, ni tumelo no kwiyala, ni micima yetu no eyi ikenisitwe ku inu no uyi, elizwalo ni tinyutu tetu tiyowisitwe ni meyi no kukena. <verse eid="HEB 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23"/>Tuleme mukongola mu kwamba eyi no sepo yetu me tu ulwile okutantalika, kakuli woyo ona tu sepisa ni wa ku sepahala. <verse eid="HEB 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24"/>Tuku babalele omunjili ku munjili mu lilato ni mu misebezi no kuwaba. <verse eid="HEB 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25"/>Tule okukana oukuwana bamweya, kanyi omwatendela anjili, kono tuku susuweze omunjili ni munjili onene kanyi omo mumonena nji eliywaa lya Mbumu kame lili beebi.<verse eid="HEB 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26"/>Kakuli nji kame tutenda esibi no ka mabomu munyima no ku limuka eniti abo kakwisa esitabelo sisiyalele no kulemena eibi. <verse eid="HEB 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27"/>Kono tucile enako no katulo ni kutweba no mulilo owo so cinge awo asi tingananyi. <verse eid="HEB 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28"/>Omunu ona ku shwaula omulawo wa Mushe, kame aibaiwa yo ka yupelwe amakeke mu upaki no aanu ayiili simba aatu. <verse eid="HEB 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29"/>Ka koto ikumana babine eyo munahana eyo sawane woyo ona ku shwaula Omwana Nyambe ni ku nyefula ounyinga no ulikani owo ana kukenisa ni ku tinisa Emebo no sishemo? <verse eid="HEB 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30"/>Kakuli tu mulimuke woyo ona kwamba nji, “Okuuseta ni kwa nge, time sa ni teneke.” Mi kame, “Nyambe yo soatula aanu aye.” <verse eid="HEB 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31"/>Oku kwela mu maoko a Nyambe no ku yoya ni sinu no ku cilisa. <verse eid="HEB 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32"/>Kono mupuluke amaywaa no weli, munyima no kumonyekelwa, kame muna kukoongota ku mayando. <verse eid="HEB 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33"/>Abanjili kame muna kushubulwangwa epatalaza mu ku anguliwa ni ku yandisiwa, mi abanjili kame muno kutabela ku utata nwawo atendiwa ngeso. <verse eid="HEB 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34"/>Kakuli kame muna kwikala ni sishemo kwawo anungilwe mi kame mu wabelelwa okutambula okusinya esifumu senu, kakuli kame mu limukile mwenyene eyi no kuwaba, esinu eso siikala okuta oku no kwaabwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35"/>Cwalehe mulese okuyumba oundume wenu owo oli ni mupuzo no kuneneba. <verse eid="HEB 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36"/>Kakuli kame mu fanena oku tundamena, nji cwale mutende esi si singwa kwa Nyambe ni kutambula eso muna sepisiwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37"/>“Kakuli kusi siyalele enako icana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">mi yonyene woyo oiiya kame saiye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">mi katamba oku liyeha.<verse eid="HEB 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38"/>Kono ange ano kuluka kame sayoye mulibaka no tumelo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">mi nji kame aukela munyima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">Omoyo wange kauwabelelwa mwa yonyene.” <verse eid="HEB 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39"/>Kono aci katuli kwawo aukela munyima mi kame asinyehile, kono aci kame tuli kwawo ali ni tumelo ni kuteula emyoyo yoo.<verse eid="HEB 10:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11"/>
  <para style="s">Etumelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1"/>Cwale etumelo eniti no inu eyo tusepa niku kolwa eyi no kwa monwa. <verse eid="HEB 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2"/>Kakuli mulibaka no tumelo aanu na kukale Nyambe nakwatambula.<verse eid="HEB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3"/>Mulibaka no tumelo kame tu yupisisa nji elitunga kame lina tendiwa ni Liywi lya Nyambe nji cwale eyo imonwa kame ina kutendiwa okutunda ku inu nokwa moniwa.<verse eid="HEB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4"/>Mulibaka no tumelo Abele kame ana ku lita balubala wa Nyambe esitabelo esi sibita sa Kaine mu sonyene ana kutambula nji wa kuluka, Nyambe kame amupaka muku tambula etimpo taye, nafu kono mu tumelo yaye osilemine okwamba. <verse eid="HEB 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5"/>Mulibaka no tumelo Inoki kame ana ku shimbiwa ku wilu nji aulwe okufa. Mi kasi kuwaniwa, kakuli Nyambe na ku mushimba. Cwale yo kasi shimbiwa kale kame ana ku wabelisa Nyambe. <verse eid="HEB 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6"/>Mi mukuulwa etumelo ka kukonahala oku wabelisa Nyambe, kakuli woyo yonje so iiya kunyonga ya Nyambe kame afanena okupumena nji Nyambe kwaali mi kame aba omupuzo awo amusaela.<verse eid="HEB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7"/>Mulibaka no tumelo Nuwe na ku lemusiwa kwa Nyambe mu inu eyo kaisiku moniwa kale. Kame ana kukuteka Nyambe ni kuyaka Aleka no ku yoyisa asindoo yaye, mulibaka no eyi Nyambe na kwatula elitunga ni kutenda omuyoli no kuluka oko kuneyi mu tumelo. <verse eid="HEB 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8"/>Mulibaka no tumelo Abulahama na kukuteka Nyambe abo ana ku isaniwa okutunda mu sibaka eso ana ku tambula kanyi ana kuyola mi sebeli otundamo yoka limukile oko ata nji kubine. <verse eid="HEB 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9"/>Mulibaka no tumelo Abulahama sebeli ofunduka okuta mu sibaka no sepiso kanyi ongenda mu sibaka eso yo yoya mu titente ni Isaka bamweya ni Jakobo ana kutambula ni yonyene esepiso imweya. <verse eid="HEB 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10"/>Kakuli kame ana kwaliketa ku mulenen̄i owo ukwite omutomo mi omuyaki ni mutendi, Nyambe.<verse eid="HEB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11"/>Mulibaka no tumelo ni yonyene Sala kame ana kutambula amaata noku leya, simba nji kame ana kukulubala kakuli kame ana ku sepa woyo ona ku musepisa. <verse eid="HEB 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12"/>Cwalehe okutunda ku mulume mumweya naba ana kumonahala kanyi nafu nakuleya olusika no kupula kanyi etitungweti na ku wilu mane kanyi oubeke no mushekesheke na ba likamba no liwate.<verse eid="HEB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13"/>Aa onje kame afile mu tumelo aka si tambula eyi ana sepisiwa, kono nai mono ni kwakeeta asili oku no ku leba, mi kame ana kulimuka nji kame atunda ku ndina mi angenda ba litunga. <verse eid="HEB 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14"/>Kakuli aanu awo aamba ngeso kame a monahaza nji kame asaela enaha yoo. <verse eid="HEB 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15"/>Kambe kame ana ku puluka enaha eyo ana kutunda, kambe kame ana kuwana omukwa no ku ukela mo. <verse eid="HEB 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16"/>Kono kanyi omo kwikalele kame a shukele enaha no ku waba yonyene eyo na ku wilu. Mulibakelyo Nyambe ka enee okumwisana nji Nyambe woo mane kame anaa lukisete omulenen̄i.<verse eid="HEB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17"/>Mulibaka no tumelo, Abulahama enako ana kwetekiwa, sebeli olita Isaka mwanaye mumweya oku mutenda esitabelo, mi yo kame ona kubiwa etisepiso, <verse eid="HEB 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18"/>Woyo ona kwambelwa mwa Isaka nji, “Aikulyowe kame sa isaniwe mwa wene.” <verse eid="HEB 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19"/>Seli okolwa nji Nyambe kame atwesa mane okwingula aafu mi mu mukwa umweya Isaka sebeli oukisetwa kwa yonyene, kanyi nimu kwingulwa kwaafu.<verse eid="HEB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20"/>Mulibaka no tumelo, Isaka kame ana fuyola Jakobo ni Isau, yo alemusa eyi saiye kuuso.<verse eid="HEB 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21"/>Mulibaka no tumelo, Jakobo aba ana kufa, sebeli ofuyola aana a Josefa ayili, sebeli olapela yo lemine ba mutwi no mulamu waye.<verse eid="HEB 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22"/>Mulibaka no tumelo, Josefa aba ana kufa, sebeli wamba eyi no kutunda kwa aana a Isilaele, mi sebeli osiya etitaelo kweyi no kupumbekiwa kwaye.<verse eid="HEB 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23"/>Mulibaka no tumelo, Mushe aba ana leiwa, sebeli oshwekiwa kwa shemiaye etikweti taatu, mu kumona nji ni mwana no kuwaba, mi kasi cila etaelo no mbumu.<verse eid="HEB 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24"/>Mulibaka no tumelo, Mushe aba ana kukula, sebeli okana okwisanwa nji mwana a Falo no mukati. <verse eid="HEB 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25"/>Kono sebeli oku ketela okuyanda naanu a Nyambe okubita nji akukole eminyaka no sibi. <verse eid="HEB 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26"/>Seli onahana nji okushubaulwa mulibaka no mayando a Kilesite ni sifumu no kuneneba esi sibita esifumu no Egepita, kakuli kame ana kwa liketa omupuzo.<verse eid="HEB 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27"/>Mulibaka no tumelo, sebeli otunda mu Egepita, mi kasi cila oku tweba kwa mbumu, kakuli kame ana kukoongota kanyi kame amona woyo no kwa monwa. <verse eid="HEB 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28"/>Mulibaka no tumelo kame ana teula epaseka ni kukwaa ounyinga, nji cwale esisinyi no aana no aeli silese okwalema.<verse eid="HEB 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29"/>Mulibaka no tumelo aanu sebeli aluta eliwate no mucaa kanyi ba likamba, kono amaengepita aba ana kweteka oku tenda ngeso, sebeli aminisiwa ku meyi.<verse eid="HEB 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30"/>Mulibaka no tumelo amamota no Jeliko sebeli akwa, aba ana kumana oku tingulukwa amaywaa atanu ni twiili (7). <verse eid="HEB 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31"/>Mulibaka no tumelo Lahaba elihule kasi kufa nawo no kwa pumena elibaka no ku tambula amatwela mu kozo.<verse eid="HEB 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32"/>Mi eyi sa naambe kame ni ibine? Kakuli kame sa ni taelelwe enako aba sa naambe eyi ya Gidiyoni, ni Balaki, ni Samisoni, ni Jefita ni Dabida, ni Samwele, neyi nwaanuhi a Nyambe. <verse eid="HEB 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33"/>Awo mu tumelo kame hapa emibuso kame ana sebeleze eniti, kame ana wana kweyi ana ku sepisiwa, kame ana tiki otunwa no andee, <verse eid="HEB 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34"/>kame ana timi amaata no mulilo, ni ku banduka ku kutweba no mukwale, kame ana ombola ku meeti, kame ana tendiwa etindume mu ndwaa, kame ana cilisa etimpi no iila. <verse eid="HEB 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35"/>Akati na tambula aafu oo mu kwinguka, anjili kame ayandisiwa ouyi, mi kame akana oku lamulelwa, nji awane okwingukela ku moyo no kuwaba ni kubita. <verse eid="HEB 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36"/>Anjili kame ayandiswa muku shubulwa, ni tipafa, ni mu mawenge mane ni titolongo. <verse eid="HEB 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37"/>Kame aibaiwa ni mawee, kame a patuliwa ba kaci, kame aibaiwa ni mukwale, kame ayambaela aku fukile eitumba no mikoko neyi no tupuli, kame ayanda, kame anungiwa mane ni kuyandisiwa onene. <verse eid="HEB 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38"/>Onyene elitunga kali sikwa fanena, kame a yambaelisiwa mu mahalaupa, ba malundu, mu mina no kucakula ba mawee, ni mu mina eyi itungile no litunga.<verse eid="HEB 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39"/>Onyene awo onje kame ana etekiwa wino kweyi no tumelo yoo, ka sitambula eyi ana sepisiwa, <verse eid="HEB 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40"/>kakuli Nyambe kame ana ku tu monena eyi no kuwaba, nji okuulwili aci katwese okutendiwa ano kupetahala.<verse eid="HEB 11:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12"/>
  <para style="s">Nyambe Sitetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1"/>Cwalehe, kakuli kame tu tingulukilwe kwaanu no kupula no tipaki, tu lese yonje eyi itwimelwa, ni sibi esi sitwiyela beebi, mi twituke mu koongota mu takano eyi ilukisitwe balubala wetu. <verse eid="HEB 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2"/>Me twa liketile kwa Jesu, yonyene omutateki ni mumaneneni no tumelo yetu. Mulibaka no ku wabelelwa oko ana kubekelwa kuuso, naku koongota ku sifapano yo ulwile oku tokomela elishwau lyaso! mane kame aikalile ku lyoko no silyo no lubona lwa Nyambe.<verse eid="HEB 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3"/>Mu puluke woyo onaku kongota kukulwisiwa kwawo asi kutende eibi, nji cwale mulese oku kwangwa simba oku zwafiswa. <verse eid="HEB 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4"/>Mu utata wenu no kulwisa esibi kamu sikeela ba nako no kwiita ounyinga wenu. <verse eid="HEB 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5"/>Cwale kame muna pulama esusuwezo eyi mu nambeliwa kwa Nyambe kanyi aana? Eyi yamba nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">“Mwanange, olese oku nyaziseza Ombumu aba aku kalimela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">simba okuzwafa aba obiwa ekoto kwa yonyene.<verse eid="HEB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6"/>Kakuli Ombumu kame asiulula woyo asinga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">mi kame aba ekoto yonje mwana woyo atambula.”<verse eid="HEB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7"/>Aba mu kalimelwa nji mu koongote, kakuli Nyambe kame ami shimba kanyi aana, kana kwaali omwana no kwa kalimelwa kwa sitaye? <verse eid="HEB 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8"/>Nji kamu kalimelwa, kanyi omo atendelwa aana onje, cwale abohe muli aana feela mi kasamuli aana no niti. <verse eid="HEB 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9"/>Okwekeza kweyi kame tu kwite asitetu no litunga awo atweleza mi kame twakuteka. Cwale ikene aba katukubeeke kunji kwa Sitetu no mebo ni moyo! <verse eid="HEB 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10"/>Kakuli onyene kame ana tu kalimele ba nako no kwibiba omo anaku monena nji kame kulukile, kono Nyambe kame atu kalimela ba uwa wetu nji tu kutabele okukena kwaye. <verse eid="HEB 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11"/>Kakuli enako yonje aba ku kalimelwa kame kuyupiswangwa okukola okubita okuwabelelwa, kono munyima kame ku beeka embuya no kozo no kuluka kwawo ana iyetiwa ngeso.<verse eid="HEB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etitaelo ni Titemuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12"/>Cwalehe munone amaoko enu anakwi, mi mongote amanwi enu no kwaaongola! <verse eid="HEB 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13"/>Mu tendele amakondo enu etindila no kooloka, nji cwale eihole iikale wino simba okubala.<verse eid="HEB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14"/>Mu tundamene oku yoya mu kozo naanu onje, ni kwikala ni ku kena, nji omunu kakwite okukena oko kakwisa woyo sokamona Ombumu. <verse eid="HEB 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15"/>Mu mone nji cwale kuulwe omunu so kwangwa okuwana esishemo sa Nyambe nji kuulwe omubisi no kulula so mene ni kulita outata mi mu onyene aanu no kupula kame sasilafazwe. <verse eid="HEB 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16"/>Kwaanyi ku lese okwikala woyo no wozwa nawo no kwa lapela kanyi Isau ona kuulisa etukelo no ukulu waye mulibaka no silya simweya. <verse eid="HEB 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17"/>Kakuli kame mulimukile nji kuuso aba na shukela oka yoola embuyoti, kame ana kukaniwa kakuli kasi kuwana esibaka no kubaka simba nji na kwimona ni myooti.<verse eid="HEB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18"/>Kakuli kamu siiya kweeso si twesiwa oku lemiwa, esi sibya omulilo, simba ouwi, ni kweena, niku lin̄ungwa. <verse eid="HEB 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19"/>Ku mulumo no tolombita, ni liywi elyo amaywi alyo kame litenda awo analiyupu okukumbela nji kulese okwikala aman̄usa sa ambiwe kwa onyenye. <verse eid="HEB 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20"/>Kakuli kasi kukoongota mu taelo eyo ina kubiwa nji, “Simba esiyamana kame silema elilundu, mbasi pwacauliwa ni mawee.” <verse eid="HEB 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21"/>Niti luli kame sina kumonahala eso Mushe ana kwamba nji, “Kame ninjanjata ni kucila!”<verse eid="HEB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22"/>Kono na mwiyi ku lilundu no Sione ni ku mulenen̄i wa Nyambe no kuyoya, Jelusalema naku wilu ni ku mangeloi aa aku wanine aa atenda eikiti-kiti okupula. <verse eid="HEB 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23"/>Ni ku kopano no aana no aaeli awo ana n̄oliwa mu liwilu, ni kwa Nyambe omwatuli no aanu onje ni ku mebo no aanu no niti awo ana tendiwa asiku patehala. <verse eid="HEB 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24"/>Ni kwa Jesu omwimaneni no ulikani no ubya, ni ku unyinga waye ou tuna kwaiwa ou wamba eyi no kuwaba onene okubita ounyinga wa Abele.<verse eid="HEB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25"/>Mumone nji mulese oku kana woyo wamba. Kakuli nji kasi kubanduka aba ana ku mukana woyo ona kwalemusa ba litunga, cwale aci ngasibine satu banduke nji kame tukana woyo wamba okutunda ku wilu! <verse eid="HEB 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26"/>Eliywi lyaye nali nyanganyisa elitunga, kono bano na sepisa nji, “Kame kani tamba oku nyanganyisa elitunga feela kono mane ni liwilu.” <verse eid="HEB 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27"/>Amaywi aa,“Kamweya kame” okumonisa okutundisiwa no inu eyo inyanganya kanyi omo ina ku tendelwa, nji cwale eyo nokwa nyanganya kame saisiyale.<verse eid="HEB 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28"/>Cwalehe tuku tumele kakuli natu tambula omubuso owo nokwa nyanganya mi tube kwa Nyambe okulumbeka oko kutambuliwa me tuli ni likute ni kucila, <verse eid="HEB 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29"/>kakuli Nyambe wetu ni mulilo ou usinya.<verse eid="HEB 12:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13"/>
  <para style="s">Omo Kuwabelisetwa Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1"/>Mulesele elilato no munu ni minaye simba mukulwaye litwalelele. <verse eid="HEB 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2"/>Mulese oku ketulula okutambula angenda. Kakuli anjili kame ana tambula amangeloi mu kwa limuka. <verse eid="HEB 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3"/>Mu puluke awo ali mu tolongo kanyi naanyi kame muli mu tolongo ni onyene nawo ayandisiwa onene, kakuli naanyi musili mu lutu. <verse eid="HEB 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4"/>Mulesele amakwala akutekiwe kwaanu onje mi mulesele omumbeta no likwala uulwe elitilo kakuli Nyambe mba atula amahule nasi kubuka.<verse eid="HEB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5"/>Mutundise omoyo wenu ku kusinga amali mi moongotete kweyo muli nayo kakuli Nyambe kame anamba nji, “Sitamba kuku lesela, simba okuku fulalela.” <verse eid="HEB 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6"/>Abakulingeso, kame sa twambe ni mucima ou ongolile nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">“Ombumu yo mutusi wange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">Sitamba kucila.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">Iikene eso satende omunu kwa mene?”<verse eid="HEB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7"/>Mu puluke awo amyendisa, awo ana myambele eliywi lya Nyambe, mu lemuhe amamaneno no moyo woo, mi mu fanikete etumelo yoo. <verse eid="HEB 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8"/>Jesu Kilesite yokame ni bingolwa, ni balelo, ni kuta oku no kwaabwa. <verse eid="HEB 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9"/>Mulese oku kelusiwa ku tituto no kupula naku ndina, kakuli esi no kuwaba ni mucima aba ukongota ni sishemo sa Nyambe, kasa oku tokomela eyi iliwa, kakuli awo ata nayo katusiwa esinjili.<verse eid="HEB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10"/>Kame tuli ni Aletale yetu, mi awo asebeza mu tende, ka kwite etukelo no kulya eyayo. <verse eid="HEB 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11"/>Mupulisita omukulu aba alita ounyinga no iyamana mu Sibaka no Kukena oku utende esitabelo mu libaka no ibi, etinyutu no iyayana kame ika cin̄elwa kundee no mafulo. <verse eid="HEB 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12"/>Cwale Jesu ni yonyene naku yanda kundee no mwelo mulibaka no kukenisa aanu ni unyinga waye. <verse eid="HEB 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13"/>Cwalehe, tu banene kwa yonyene ku ndee no mafulo, me tu shimbile oku shubulwa kwaye. <verse eid="HEB 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14"/>Kakuli kuno ka tu tende omulenen̄i no kwaabwa, kono kame tu saela omulenen̄i owo sa wiye. <verse eid="HEB 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15"/>Cwale mwa Jesu tulitele Nyambe esitabelo no milumbeko, eso ninji embuya eyo itunda mu tunwa oto tu lumba elitina lyaye. <verse eid="HEB 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16"/>Mulese okwatenda eyi no kuwaba nuukutabela eyo mukwite na kwenu kakuli eitabelo eyo kame iwabelisa Nyambe.<verse eid="HEB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17"/>Mukuteke awo amyendisa, mi muku beeke kunji yoo, kakuli kame atonena Emyoyo yenu, abakulingeso kame sa ibangutwe yayo. Mwalese atende eyi mu kuwabelelwa kasa mu kweena kakuli eso kasitamba oku mi tusa esinjili.<verse eid="HEB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18"/>Mu tulapelele kakuli kame tu kolwa nji elizwalo lyetu ni lya kuwaba, ni nji mu inu yonje kame tu singa oku tenda esi si lukanela. <verse eid="HEB 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19"/>Kame ni kumbela onene luli nji mu tende ngeso, nji nusetwe kwaanyi muwangu.<verse eid="HEB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etapelo no ku yatila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20"/>Cwale Nyambe no kozo yonyene uyu una usu kwa afu Ombumu wetu Jesu, omulisani no mikoko, mu unyinga no ulikani no kwaabwa. <verse eid="HEB 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21"/>Ami tende ano petahala mu misebezi no kuwaba yonje, nji mu tende esi singwa kwa yonyene asebeze mu micima yenu eyo imuwabelisa mu miyo aye mwa Jesu Kilesite, ekanya ikale kwa yonyene okuta oku no kwaabwa. Amen! <verse eid="HEB 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22"/>Abaange, kame ni kumbela nji mu tambule wino amaywi no kutazo eyo, kakuli elin̄olo ni mi n̄olela ni lya kwibiba. <verse eid="HEB 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23"/>Mu limuke nji omwabetu Timoteya, na lukululwa mu tolongo aba sa iye wangu mba ni ka mi mona naye.<verse eid="HEB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24"/>Mukeete awo amyendisa onje, naanu a Nyambe no kukena onje. Awo atunda mu Italiya kame ami keeta.<verse eid="HEB 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25"/>Esishemo si ikale naanyi moonje. Ameni<verse eid="HEB 13:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13"/>
</usx>
